<title>FRANCE: CEP compulsary buyout offer March 19-April 3 - SBF.</title>
<headline>CEP compulsary buyout offer March 19-April 3 - SBF.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A compulsary buyout offer by Havas for the shares of CEP Communication followed by delisting, will run from March 19 through April 3, the Societe des Bourses Francaises (SBF) said on Monday.</p>
<p>Ste Generale, acting on behalf of Havas, is offering to pay 470 francs a share and 10 francs per equity warrant, the SBF said.</p>
<p>Havas holds 99.39 percent of the shares and voting rights of CEP Communication and 3,700,189 equity warrants out of 3,839,143 following its public tender.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
